uard tests (commit under obtuse-phenocryst-verdin) and the 7 test_uv_pin_guard cases (commit under arctic-unsecular-esok). Both are test-only and render expected paths in POSIX form. The other 2, test_run_git_encodes_str_stdin_as_utf8, come from 04e175d70eb (livid-painful-mosquito), not A1, and are tracked by scholastic-travelsick-salmon (CRLF on text-mode stdin, confirmed by blob hash).","timestamp":1795087543244584943},{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Update (2026-11-19 PST): `test.yml` on main at fa383b1d195 (run 44534782876, job `sweep (windows)` 135597358757): 9 failed, 20,241 passed. All 14 failures listed above are gone (fixed by 8c7a9d2ef76, 6140d037413, fed304b2973 and others). New failures, none present at 92d3f373e2c:\n- `tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_plan_review_gate.py`: 8 drift tests (`test_code_drift_in_dependency_file_invalidates`, `test_container_child_declared_file_drift_invalidates`, `test_container_unrelated_commit_does_not_invalidate`, `test_drift_refresh_escalates_on_probe_finding`, `test_drift_refresh_reuses_on_immaterial_drift`, `test_drift_refreshed_attestation_carries_a_verified_at_sha`, `test_progressive_drift_refresh_always_takes_probe`, `test_refreshed_attestation_rebinds_to_current_code`). Claim fails with \"cannot confirm the code the plan was reviewed against is current\" instead of the expected drift verdict.\n- `tests/unit/test_fixture_env_repr_security.py::test_fixture_failure_does_not_render_unrelated_ambient_secret[tests.scripts.test_observability_exit-healthy_env-None]`.\nCommits merged between the two runs: 79f46cde8a4 (snapshot build paths), 6140d037413, 8c7a9d2ef76, f8e9ea0e61f, fed304b2973, 5cde271a8ee, fa383b1d195. Which one introduced the drift failures has not been established.","timestamp":1795101315218561033},{"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Evidence for the acceptance criterion (2026-11-19 PST): the dispatch on main at 0fec72331c4 (2026-11-19 13:40 PST), run 44621093373, job sweep (windows) 135902646205, concluded success with 20269 passed, 872 skipped and no failures. All 14 failures listed in the description are gone. Later main runs fail only tests that have their own tickets: test_mcp_opcert_signing_goose.py::test_compose_startup_binding_fails_closed_on_bad_key (plump-smelly-indianabat; runs 44636174645 and 44649102885) and test_identity_ts3_117b.py::test_off_keyring_signature_fails_enforcement (legatine-good-feline; run 44649102885). No repository change under this ticket.","timestamp":1795147639839367001}],"completion_expectation":"required","created_at":1795087161479914659,"creation_channel":"mcp","deps":[{"link_uuid":"fdeef63b-3124-4a91-bded-f7cb37c53dff","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"bb9f-ecd8-06dc-4521"},{"link_uuid":"99804fcd-4d8c-4800-bf8c-e6c25119361f","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"453c-cad2-fab5-456d"},{"link_uuid":"da3e7363-73d3-4643-99e6-30259e89eb45","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"3e8c-b2fc-d34e-4a36"},{"link_uuid":"2bf5a03a-9dcd-4e2c-8e8b-7551f6cec9d4","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"8983-a808-7ad5-4d20"}],"description":"## Observation (2026-11-19 PST)\n`test.yml` dispatched on main at `92d3f373e2c` (run 44503581058), job `sweep (windows)` 135490319213: 14 failed, 20,016 passed.\n- 12 also failed on main at `3f47117c97b` (run 44487190183, job 135433617476, 13 failures). They compare backslash paths against forward-slash expectations or vice versa:\n  - `tests/unit/store/test_store_paths.py::test_exactly_one_rebar_dir_definition_under_src`\n  - `tests/unit/test_repo_root_from_package_guard.py::test_the_only_sanctioned_site_is_the_resolver_seam`\n  - `tests/unit/test_repo_root_from_tracker_guard.py` (2 tests)\n  - `tests/unit/test_single_definition_helpers.py::test_the_argparse_positive_int_is_defined_once_and_its_namesake_survives`\n  - `tests/unit/test_uv_pin_guard.py` (7 tests): the expected message uses `infra\\compose\\Dockerfile.svc`, while the script prints `infra/compose/Dockerfile.svc`.\n- 2 are new since `04e175d70eb` (ticket `livid-painful-mosquito`, closed): `tests/unit/test_git_ssh_output_encoding.py::test_run_git_encodes_str_stdin_as_utf8[process-group]` and `[subprocess-run]` (blob SHA mismatch on Windows, which points at a newline translation of the stdin text).\n- The previous run's one other failure, `test_store_commit_maintenance_bd66.py::test_write_survives_foreground_maintenance_repack` (worker crash), did not recur.\n\n## Resolution evidence (2026-11-19 PST)\nAll 14 failures are fixed on main by commits that landed under other tickets: the 5 path-separator guard tests (obtuse-phenocryst-verdin), the 7 `test_uv_pin_guard.py` cases (arctic-unsecular-esok), and the 2 `test_run_git_encodes_str_stdin_as_utf8` cases (scholastic-travelsick-salmon). None of the 14 node ids appears in `.github/windows-sweep-deselect/unclassified.args` (the only remaining deselect file), and none of the 6 test modules carries a Windows `skipif`.\n`gh workflow run test.yml --ref main` dispatch run 44621093373 at `0fec72331c4` (2026-11-19 13:40 PST): job `sweep (windows)` 135902646205 concluded `success`, \"20269 passed, 872 skipped\" with no failure.\nThe 2 failures in later main runs are owned elsewhere: `test_mcp_opcert_signing_goose.py::test_compose_startup_binding_fails_closed_on_bad_key` by plump-smelly-indianabat, and `test_identity_ts3_117b.py::test_off_keyring_signature_fails_enforcement` (new at `9a6ed375112`) by legatine-good-feline.\n\n## Approach\nVerification-only close. No repository file changes under this ticket: the fixes already landed under the tickets named above, so this ticket records the dispatch evidence and closes.\n\n## Scope\nNo repository files. Evidence lives in this ticket's description and comments (run and job ids above).\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [x] `sweep (windows)` on main passes, or each remaining failure has its own ticket; verified by the job result of a `gh workflow run test.yml --ref main` dispatch.","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"none","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","managed_refs":[["relates_to","3e8c-b2fc-d34e-4a36"],["relates_to","453c-cad2-fab5-456d"],["relates_to","8983-a808-7ad5-4d20"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"Why no repository files change: the 14 failures were fixed by commits already on main under obtuse-phenocryst-verdin, arctic-unsecular-esok and scholastic-travelsick-salmon; this ticket only verifies. Where output or evidence lives: Windows run 44621093373 / job 135902646205, recorded in this ticket's description.","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"d1cf37c6-5c40-4738-9d33-d73b19e97fbd","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"releases":[],"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"closed","tags":["windows"],"ticket_id":"e816-b30a-6a5c-4ae4","ticket_type":"bug","title":"Windows sweep on main fails 14 tests: path separators in guard tests, uv-pin messages, and the new run_git stdin encoding test","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["3da0366c-2072-426f-8eaa-26fd78bca0c8","67e2a4c9-16ff-4a2a-8c5e-8bb327ef579b","913e58a9-53f2-4369-bb48-624fe55a8395","2bf5a03a-9dcd-4e2c-8e8b-7551f6cec9d4","3da9c95d-b414-473f-af6e-7005ebeb2763","b44fc94a-4b64-41af-91a2-8c011a06bc46","69bff5e7-2a2f-4e10-94a0-60837ea2290b","a2704a99-8779-4e42-9138-2bf8b9f0ecd0","3c0dba32-c5d7-405b-8288-cdd146f694ab","d1cf37c6-5c40-4738-9d33-d73b19e97fbd","e9e8e8bb-6222-4ff6-93ec-2a63f0cd398d"]},"env_id":"","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1795150190295163002,"uuid":"9619db4d-99d6-4cf9-a6c0-20810001cd9a"}